    {
      "source": "JDK 17+ (Can be <a href=\"https://openjdk.java.net\">OpenJDK</a> or <a href=\"https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/index.html\">Oracle JDK</a>)",
      "translation": "JDK 17 及以上版本（可以是<a href=\"https://openjdk.java.net\">OpenJDK</a>或<a href=\"https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/index.html\">Oracle JDK</a>）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Maven 3.8.5 (We provide the Maven wrapper, see <code>mvnw</code> respectively <code>mvnw.cmd</code> in the project root; the wrapper downloads the appropriate Maven version automatically)",
      "translation": "Maven 3.8.5（我们提供了 Maven 包装器，请参阅项目根目录中的<code>mvnw</code>或<code>mvnw.cmd</code>；该包装器会自动下载合适的 Maven 版本）",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "or indirectly via <a href=\"https://www.testcontainers.org\">Testcontainers</a> and <a href=\"https://www.docker.com\">Docker</a>",
      "translation": "或通过<a href=\"https://www.testcontainers.org\">Testcontainers</a>和<a href=\"https://www.docker.com\">Docker</a>间接使用",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you don’t have <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Docker_(software)\">Docker</a> installed, head over to <a href=\"https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop\">Docker Desktop</a>.\nIn short, Docker is a tool that helps you running lightweight software images using OS-level virtualization in so-called containers.",
      "translation": "如果您尚未安装<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Docker_(software)\">Docker</a>，请访问<a href=\"https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop\">Docker Desktop</a>。\n简而言之，Docker 是一个工具，它利用操作系统级别的虚拟化技术，在所谓的容器中帮助您运行轻量级软件镜像。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Please download the version applicable to your operating system and follow the instructions to start it.\nA required step is to open a browser and go to <a class=\"bare\" href=\"http://localhost:7474\">localhost:7474</a> after you started the database and change the default password from <code>neo4j</code> to something of your liking.",
      "translation": "请下载适用于您操作系统的版本，并按照说明启动它。\n在启动数据库后，必须执行以下步骤：打开浏览器并访问 <a class=\"bare\" href=\"http://localhost:7474\">localhost:7474</a>，然后将默认密码 <code>neo4j</code> 更改为您喜欢的内容。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Password for the <code>neo4j</code> user of the instance configured with <code>SDN_NEO4J_URL</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>SDN_NEO4J_URL</code> 配置的实例中 <code>neo4j</code> 用户的密码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Our build uses <a href=\"https://www.testcontainers.org/modules/databases/neo4j/\">Testcontainers Neo4j</a> to bring up a database instance.",
      "translation": "我们的构建使用 <a href=\"https://www.testcontainers.org/modules/databases/neo4j/\">Testcontainers Neo4j</a> 来启动数据库实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can get a copy of Neo4j at our <a href=\"https://neo4j.com/download-center/#enterprise\">download center</a> free of charge.",
      "translation": "您可以在我们的<a href=\"https://neo4j.com/download-center/#enterprise\">下载中心</a>免费获取 Neo4j 的副本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "After that, you can run a complete build by specifying the local <code>bolt</code> URL:",
      "translation": "之后，您可以通过指定本地 `<code>bolt</code>` 地址来运行完整构建：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Version of the Neo4j docker image to use, see <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/neo4j\">Neo4j Docker Official Images</a>",
      "translation": "要使用的 Neo4j Docker 镜像版本，请参阅<a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/_/neo4j\">Neo4j Docker 官方镜像</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A Neo4j 5.+ database, either",
      "translation": "Neo4j 5+ 数据库，任一版本均可。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "running locally",
      "translation": "本地运行",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Choosing JDK 17 is a decision influenced by various aspects",
      "translation": "选择 JDK 17 是一个受多方面因素影响的决定。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "SDN is a Spring Data project.\nSpring Data commons baseline is JDK 17 and so is Spring Framework’s baseline.\nThus, it is only natural to keep the JDK 17 baseline.",
      "translation": "SDN 是一个 Spring Data 项目。\nSpring Data Commons 的基线是 JDK 17，Spring Framework 的基线也是如此。\n因此，保持 JDK 17 的基线是顺理成章的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following sections are alternatives and roughly sorted by increased effort.",
      "translation": "以下各节为替代方案，大致按所需努力程度递增排序。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "All builds require a local copy of the project:",
      "translation": "所有构建都需要项目的本地副本：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Before you proceed, verify your locally installed JDK version.\nThe output should be similar:",
      "translation": "在继续之前，请验证您本地安装的 JDK 版本。\n输出应类似于：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "On a Windows machine, use",
      "translation": "在 Windows 机器上，使用",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The output should be similar.",
      "translation": "输出应保持一致。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The image version to use can be configured through an environmental variable like this:",
      "translation": "可通过环境变量配置要使用的图像版本，例如：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Here we are using 5.3.0 enterprise and also accept the license agreement.",
      "translation": "此处我们使用的是 5.3.0 企业版，并已接受许可协议。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Consult your operating system or shell manual on how to define environment variables if specifying them inline does not work for you.",
      "translation": "如果内联指定环境变量不起作用，请咨询您的操作系统或 Shell 手册以了解如何定义环境变量。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Building against a locally running database is faster, as it does not restart a container each time.\nWe do this a lot during our development.",
      "translation": "针对本地运行的数据库构建速度更快，因为它无需每次重启容器。我们在开发过程中经常这样做。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Some tests may require the enterprise edition of Neo4j.\nWe build and test against the enterprise edition internally, but we won’t force you\nto accept the license if you don’t want to.",
      "translation": "某些测试可能需要使用 Neo4j 企业版。我们在内部构建和测试时使用的是企业版，但如果您不愿意接受其许可协议，我们不会强制您接受。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Setting this environment allows connecting to a locally running Neo4j instance.\nWe use this a lot during development.",
      "translation": "设置此环境可连接到本地运行的 Neo4j 实例。我们在开发过程中经常使用它。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "There is no quality gate in place at the moment to ensure that the code/test ratio stays as is, but please consider adding tests to your contributions.",
      "translation": "目前尚未设立质量门禁以确保代码与测试的比例保持不变，但请考虑为您的贡献添加测试。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "We have some rather mild checkstyle rules in place, enforcing more or less default Java formatting rules.\nYour build will break on formatting errors or something like unused imports.",
      "translation": "我们实施了一些较为宽松的 Checkstyle 规则，大致遵循默认的 Java 格式化规范。  \n如果代码存在格式错误或类似未使用的导入等问题，构建将会失败。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
